# Dingus Egg deals two damage to each destroyed land's controller, including the sacrificed Strip Mine's controller (CR 603.2, 120.3).
[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Pearl
Dingus Egg
Strip Mine
Island x20
[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20
[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Strip Mine.Play
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: White)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Dingus Egg.Cast
